# ── Google OAuth (needed for "Sign in with Google") ───────────────────────────
#
# HOW TO GET THESE VALUES:
# 1. Firebase Console → Authentication → Sign-in method → Google → Enable → Save
# 2. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials?project=baby-monitor-a2e04
# 3. Find "Web client (auto created by Google Service)" → click it
# 4. Under "Authorised redirect URIs" add:
#      https://auth.expo.io/@harkishansohanpal/BabyMonitorApp
# 5. Save → copy the Client ID below
#
